n the original.\u00a0</p>\n<p>Crafted to fit effortlessly into your game. \"Make This Putt\" is a reminder to have confidence on the green. You need to believe that the putt is going in.\u00a0</p>\n<p>The sleek, compact shape saves space in your pocket, while the strong magnet keeps the ball mark secure during play. Made with an all-natural formula, the balm provides lasting moisture to protect your lips in any weather. It\u2019s a practical solution made fore golfers, that was designed for those who love the game.\u00a0</p>", "published_at": "2025-10-25T16:13:48-04:00", "created_at": "2025-10-25T16:13:46-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T11:02:38-04:00", "vendor": "Birdie Balm", "product_type": "", "tags": [], "variants": [{"id": 44616092221487, "title": "Default Title", "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "sku": null, "requires_shipping": true, "taxable": true, "featured_image": null, "available": true, "price": "22.99", "grams": 32, "compare_at_price": null, "position": 1, "product_id": 8089046220847, "created_at": "2025-10-25T16:13:47-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-21T11:02:38-04:00"}], "images": [{"id": 37913655607343, "created_at": "2025-10-25T16:09:55-04:00", "position": 1, "updated_at": "2025-10-25T16:09:56-04:00", "product_id": 8089046220847, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2839/6372/files/DSC03942.jpg?v=1761422996", "width": 3000, "height": 3000}, {"id": 37913658621999, "created_at": "2025-10-25T16:13:32-04:00", "position": 2, "updated_at": "2025-10-25T16:13:34-04:00", "product_id": 8089046220847, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2839/6372/files/DSC03938.jpg?v=1761423214", "width": 3000, "height": 3000}, {"id": 37913655541807, "created_at": "2025-10-25T16:09:55-04:00", "position": 3, "updated_at": "2025-10-25T16:09:57-04:00", "product_id": 8089046220847, "variant_ids": [], "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2839/6372/files/DSC03981.jpg?v=1761422997", "width": 3000, "h